  "headline": "Oxacillin sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; current supply at Corvale General is 25.6 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D2", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include oxacillin sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 389 vials of the 1 g injection, which at a use rate of 15.2 vials per day provides 25.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based check finds no FDA shortage posting before an action at a registered plant, so the state is classified as check.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top ranked purchasing option is to buy from Armas Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is also not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Armas Pharmaceuticals Inc. is supplied by ONESOURCE SPECIALTY PHARMA LIMITED - Beta Lactam Division, whose last inspection was VAI on 2019-02-14.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer is Onesource Specialty Pharma Limited, supplied by the same plant with a VAI inspection on 2019-02-14.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A third option is Baxter Healthcare Corporation, whose label names no plant that could be placed.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
